Review PR 412 for ABC-981. Ticket text: 'After adding two items offline and saving, only the first item is stored once the app is back online.' Diff of the PR (the only file it changes):

--- a/src/sync/queue.ts
+++ b/src/sync/queue.ts
@@ -41,3 +41,3 @@ export function enqueueSave(cart: Cart) {
-  const items = cart.items.filter((i) => i.id);
+  const items = cart.items.filter((i) => i.id || i.tempId);
   queue.push({ type: 'save', items });
 }

Another file, not in the PR, src/sync/flush.ts line 22:
  const payload = job.items.map((i) => ({ id: i.id, qty: i.qty }));
The API ignores items that arrive without an id and still returns 200.
